title: "GUIDE: Grounded Universal Instructional Design Evaluator"
abstract: >-
  A learning-science framework of 10 archetypes and 60 theory-grounded
  dimensions, mapped to the ADDIE lifecycle, for designing and evaluating
  instructional content with an LLM-as-a-judge.
